{"id": "68748", "title": "小兵方恒", "author": "静舟小妖", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 47, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68748.htm", "intro": "方恒是被他老爸硬逼着参的军，带着一心向往军旅生活的‘葫芦兄弟’，就这么糊里糊涂地闯进了军营。\r\n连长英姿飒爽，排长伪善腹黑，战友嘴巴花花，热热闹闹的大锅炖，时间长了，方恒觉得军营这地方其实也挺不错。\r\n只是……\r\n“你说什么？老子娘？哪儿娘了？？老子这是纯天然的遗传基因好不好？？”\r\n“什么！？诱受！？你不想活了是不是？？”\r\n某人揽着他的腰，嘴角上的梨涡深深旋出，“嗯，没事，你不诱我诱，乖了，别炸毛……”\r\n\r\n\r\n内容标签：强强 军旅 高干 欢喜冤家", "base": "files/article/html/68/68748", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10544059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10544060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10544061.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10544062.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10544063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10544064.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10544065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10544066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10544067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10544068.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10544069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10544070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10544071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10544072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "10544073.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "10544074.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "10544075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-90", "file": "10544076.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-95", "file": "10544077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-100", "file": "10544078.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-105", "file": "10544079.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-110", "file": "10544080.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-114完结", "file": "10544081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5